 {
  "vid": "16945007-bd26-5b62-ad5f-bbe72b288e9b",
  "name": "LittlePinkPotato — AI Job Search & Resume Agent",
  "family": "agenton_v2",
  "desc": "LittlePinkPotato is an AI job-search agent. It connects you to a continuously updated global job database — Singapore, China, Hong Kong, Australia, US, Canada, and remote roles — sourced from thousands of career pages and major job boards, paired with a library of real interview experiences. \n\nWhat it does: \n\n• Job matching — describe what you're looking for in plain language. Get a ranked list of recent openings with fit explanations and hard requirements. • Resume tailoring — rewrite your resume against a specific JD. Returns a structured resume plus ATS keyword-match analysis. Delivered as text and DOCX/PDF. \n\n• Cover letter — generates a ready-to-send letter from your resume and the target JD.\n\n • Interview prep — builds a prep report from real interview data: rounds, common questions, and how to approach them. Every request returns a readable text answer. Resume, cover letter, and report services also deliver document files. Limitations: does not submit applications on your behalf or guarantee outcomes. Job listings come from public sources and may be delayed. Not a substitute for visa, legal, or tax advice. Only submit materials you are authorized to share.",
